  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄑᆤ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">렁<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">랑<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FY21UkQbUBQ?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">船<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">준ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">回航<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">훼항ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tân-ai’e láng, tân-bo-jún hue-háng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飄浪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">真<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">振動<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">딘ˆ당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    phiāu-lōng’e láng, sīm-jiéng jīn-tîn-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">奈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">내ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">忍心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">띰ˆ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">將<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-nāi’e goà, rîm-sîm jiōng-lî-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">異鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">이형ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">야-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    i-hiông’e goà, wi-lì ya-yā bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">男兒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">람띠ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">아<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飄浪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄑᆤˉ렁ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">運命<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lam-rí sīm-siâ̰, ā phiāu-lōng’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">論<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">룬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">霜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">승ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셓</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">抑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">얗</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">괄ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">헤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">算<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">승`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-lun-sn̄g-seh, yah-si-hōng-koá̰, hê lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">唯一<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心疼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ턀</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-it’e sīm-thia̰, si-sīm-ai’e jai-gûn-bang-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">붇ˆ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">叫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">교</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">名<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pût-sí kio’tio gùn’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: abso