ap\">抑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">얗</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">괄ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">헤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">算<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">승`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-lun-sn̄g-seh, yah-si-hōng-koá̰, hê lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">唯一<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心疼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ턀</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt><